Icon set: VLC Redesign

Designed by Juxtopposed (https://juxtopposed.com), from the Figma Community
file "VLC Redesign (Community)". See also the designer's video about the
redesign: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ERFeOgqk324

All credit for the icon designs goes to the designer. The SVGs in this
directory are generated from the Figma source by normalize.py (viewBox
normalization and recoloring to VLC's SVGColorImage placeholder colors);
the shapes are unchanged.

The license terms of the Figma Community file apply to these icons.
